{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Alchemist's Cards",
    "steam_appid": 3745270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745270/extras/6e54f2bb71c9ee50d97b4e866da83bb0.avif?t=1749590877\" data-has-big width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the kingdom of Navitea!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the lucky owner of a traveling potion shop that can journey all across the kingdom. Every day, all sorts of customers with unique requests will come to you. Your task is to meet their needs by selling the right potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each potion has special properties and provides different effects. They can not only be sold but also used in battle! Fight monsters, gather rare ingredients, and then grow them on your farm. Explore mysterious dungeons, experiment with recipes, and create powerful elixirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to brew potions?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a special room, you can create magical mixtures: grind ingredients into powder, add them to the cauldron, set the right temperature, stir three times\u2014and poof!\u2014the potion is ready! Collect recipes, defeat monsters, experiment, and keep an eye on your budget to avoid bankruptcy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode \u2013 Immerse yourself in the story of Ruben, a young man who inherited massive debts\u2026 and an annoying frog. But it's not all bad! Soon, Emilio\u2014the heir of a noble family\u2014appears on the doorstep of his shop, offering the hero a chance to compete for a substantial prize. Be the first to reach the scorching city of Hafa and claim the reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal and Hard Modes \u2013 Here, the story is unavailable, but you can freely explore every corner of the kingdom without restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745270/extras/3cd727ef0e6efdabdde36ca37f017801.avif?t=1749590877\" data-has-big width=800 height=506 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745270/extras/6e54f2bb71c9ee50d97b4e866da83bb0.avif?t=1749590877\" data-has-big width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the kingdom of Navitea!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the lucky owner of a traveling potion shop that can journey all across the kingdom. Every day, all sorts of customers with unique requests will come to you. Your task is to meet their needs by selling the right potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each potion has special properties and provides different effects. They can not only be sold but also used in battle! Fight monsters, gather rare ingredients, and then grow them on your farm. Explore mysterious dungeons, experiment with recipes, and create powerful elixirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to brew potions?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a special room, you can create magical mixtures: grind ingredients into powder, add them to the cauldron, set the right temperature, stir three times\u2014and poof!\u2014the potion is ready! Collect recipes, defeat monsters, experiment, and keep an eye on your budget to avoid bankruptcy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode \u2013 Immerse yourself in the story of Ruben, a young man who inherited massive debts\u2026 and an annoying frog. But it's not all bad! Soon, Emilio\u2014the heir of a noble family\u2014appears on the doorstep of his shop, offering the hero a chance to compete for a substantial prize. Be the first to reach the scorching city of Hafa and claim the reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal and Hard Modes \u2013 Here, the story is unavailable, but you can freely explore every corner of the kingdom without restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745270/extras/3cd727ef0e6efdabdde36ca37f017801.avif?t=1749590877\" data-has-big width=800 height=506 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Alchemist's Cards is a casual 2D visual novel with card-based mechanics. Grow plants, brew potions, then sell or use them in battle! Explore the kingdom of Navitea, uncover secrets, and fight your way out of debt in this charming adventure.",
